  "changes": [
    "Teaching course cards provide Settings, Manage and Classroom actions. Existing own classes open directly; published courses without a class use the existing class-opening flow. Unlisted courses without a class and classes belonging to other teachers remain disabled.",
    "Settings combines permission-aware publication and release-claim actions. Original dialogs and confirmations are retained.",
    "Teacher login removes the duplicate global Classroom navigation; student login retains student Classroom navigation even when the same account can teach.",
    "Teachers or administrators may confirm deletion of ended classroom sessions. Classroom lists, detail access and imports exclude deleted sessions; attempts, progress, participants, items and original numbering remain stored.",
    "Passed classroom results use green for one submission and purple for multiple submissions, including the grid, student table, answer header, legend and accessible descriptions."
  ],
